      "Each lavatory shall be provided with hot and cold running water, or tepid running water in warm climate locations. Hand soap or similar cleansing agents shall be provided. Individual hand towels or sections thereof, of cloth or paper, air blowers or clean individual sections of continuous cloth toweling, convenient to the lavatories, shall be provided."
