      "Documented assessments of employee exposures to identify those exposed and requiring surveillance. Documentation to prove 100% participation in the program by exposed employees. Auditor reviews of site tracking tools/EMR.Review of randomly selected records of employees, (including participants not participating due to unavoidable absence) by the auditor, or a review or report from a peer reviewer, neighboring site that demonstrates compliance."
